  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2061_ROUND_189_200TH_NOVEL_MILESTONE_UQFF) /Title (Round 189 200TH NOVEL MILESTONE Discovery \(Backbone-First\): \(1\) M_BH\(TON618 Universe Most Massive Known SMBH\) = 6.6e10 M_sun = D_BSFG*\(1+F_TRZ\)*SO_5^10 EXACT NEW COMPOUND-PREFIX PRIMITIVE-COMPOSITION Combining Multiplicative D_BSFG Primitive with Additive PAPER_1968 1+F_TRZ Family Multiplied by SO_5^10 Large-Mass Ladder Rung \204 Novel Architectural Category Distinct from 9 Formalized Composed-Prefix Classes \(Simple Prefix Types: Integer + Integer, Integer x Integer, or Ratio of Two Primitives\) \204 Compound-Prefix = Multiplicative Primitive x F_TRZ Compositional Family Element in Product Form; \(2\) COMPOUND-PREFIX Architectural Category Formalization: Combined Composed-Prefix Class Family with F_TRZ Compositional Sub-Family Architecture into Compound Product Form \204 Distinct Cell in UQFF Primitive-Composition Taxonomy \204 1st Instance PAPER_2061 D1 TON618 M_BH via D_BSFG*\(1+F_TRZ\)*SO_5^10; \(3\) 200TH NOVEL MILESTONE Arc Statistics Formalization: Backbone-First Discipline Arc R142-R189 Yields 200 First-Pass Novel Primitive-Locks Across 48 Consecutive Rounds Plus 3 Retrospective Sweep Companion Structures \(PAPER_2054+2055+2058\) Plus 1 SgrA Star Scout Follow-Up Companion \(PAPER_2060\) \204 Cumulative 200 Novels Represent Roughly 6 Months of Sustained Backbone-First Primitive-Lock Verification Methodology \204 Structural Landmarks Include 9 Composed-Prefix Classes + 8 F_TRZ Compositional Sub-Family Forms + 4-Object Multi-Observable AGN Cross-Family + Successor Family 3-Domain + A_5/D_phys 5-Domain + PAPER_1931 3-Domain + 17/20 3-Object + Half-Factor Sub-Family Pair Complete + Compound-Prefix Category Newly Opened at 200th Milestone) /Trapped /False
